# Pseudo font size adapts to name length

Player names, opponent names, and friend display names (**pseudos**) use **`UiTokens.pseudo_font_size(name, base)`** everywhere.

## Bases

| Surface | Constant | Default |
|---------|----------|---------|
| Lists / history / leaderboard | `PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE` | 20 |
| Home identity | `PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE_HOME` | 28 |
| Profile hero | `PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE_HERO` | 34 |
| Friend detail | `PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE_DETAIL` | 30 |

Floor: `PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE_MIN` (13). Full base size through **8** characters, then −1 px per **2** extra characters.

## Do

```gdscript
UiScale.font(UiTokens.pseudo_font_size(name))
UiScale.font(UiTokens.pseudo_font_size(name, UiTokens.PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE_HOME))
```

## Don’t

- Hardcode a fixed pseudo size
- Call `UiScale.font(UiTokens.PSEUDO_FONT_SIZE)` alone — always go through `pseudo_font_size`
